+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+The frame carries no user id and there is no field for one: the server lists the conversations of
+the user its `WsAuthenticator` returned for that connection ([validated by: answers the connecting user's own conversations even when the frame names another user](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L76)). A `before` is accepted
+only carrying both fields, since a cursor on a time alone skips a conversation when two share one.
 
